{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02275","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02275@rel:R21-11#fe51cccb","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02275","release":"R21-11","content":"The Os Low Proxy shall create one TimingEvent per configured SwCluCOsProxyDispatcherTimingEvent container in the partition specific Service Software Component according [SWS_SwCluC_02272]. The attributes of the TimingEvent shall be set as following: • shortName is set according the container's shortName • startOnEvent is set to the RunnableEntity according [SWS_SwCluC_02273] related to the owning SwCluCOsProxyOsTaskDis- patcher container • period value is set according the SwCluCOsProxyTimingEventPeriod pa- rameter • disabledMode (s) are created according the SwCluCOsProxyDisabledMod- eInstanceRef (s) where for each different PPortPrototype an RPortPro- totype is created at the owing Service Software Component according [SWS_SwCluC_02272] and used as contextPort .","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_SoftwareClusterConnection.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:13:11+00:00","cleaning":{"rule":"spec-text-clean@1","raw_sha256":"fe51cccb1dd47cee99e9db5711c9fc7d2a20e30cf77768c891b2ae9c0c884214","removed":["123 of 715 Document ID 974: AUTOSAR_SWS_SoftwareClusterConnection Specification of Software Cluster Connection module AUTOSAR CP R21-11"]},"text_key":"d845fee18a9d"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02275","release":"R22-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02275","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02275","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_SwCluC_02275","release":"R25